AGE: then content, then METADATA_JSON: JSON with agent \"agent_1\" and vote.\n\nLet's craft concise argument: Acknowledge Agent 3's points, note that Candidate B's reliability, stress handling, technical competence outweigh C's lack of reliability and adaptability. Also note D's lack of high-stress examples. Conclude B.\n\nProceed."}
